What was taken from upstream
----------------------------
- The 17 modules under src/ that form the flat-terrain toolkit
  (core.js, generators.js, filters.js, influences.js, scatter.js, grass.js,
  materials.js, noise.js, worley.js, gaussian.js, brownian.js, analysis.js,
  tint.js, images.js, weightedBoxBlurGaussian.js, random.js, index.js) are
  retained unmodified for reference and potential reuse.
- The convention that the generation layer carries no three.js dependency.
- The deterministic random-number approach (a seeded stream passed explicitly
  rather than replacing Math.random).

What this project adds
----------------------
- src/noise3d.js    3D Simplex noise (upstream noise.js is 2D only), fBm,
                    ridged multifractal, domain warping, and a lattice-offset
                    fix for the zero-at-integer-lattice property.
- src/seed.js       FNV-1a master seed with per-subsystem stream derivation.
- src/icosphere.js  Icosphere subdivision with a CSR vertex-adjacency table.
- src/plates.js     Tectonic plate growth and boundary classification
                    (listed as an unimplemented idea in upstream roadmap.md 3.1).
- src/heightfield.js  Spherical height field synthesis, thermal erosion,
                    analytic displaced normals.
- src/ocean.js, src/clouds.js, src/atmosphere.js, src/rings.js,
  src/starfield.js   Five render subsystems.
- src/shaders/biome.js  Elevation/slope driven biome ramping.
- src/planet.js     Scene composition with separate rebuild and live paths.
- src/params.js     Declarative parameter schema driving UI, URL, export, tests.
- src/ui.js, src/io.js, src/main.js, index.html, src/style.css
                    Application shell, panel, GLB/JSON/PNG export.
- test/, e2e/, scripts/  Verification and benchmark harnesses.

