3D Simplex noise implementation
-------------------------------
The algorithm in src/noise3d.js follows Stefan Gustavson's reference
implementation (public domain), in the same lineage that upstream src/noise.js
credits ("josephg/noisejs which is public domain"), converted to an explicit
seeded permutation table so it can participate in deterministic reproduction.
